{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213450","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213450","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1421345001:1":{"text":"...전부 ...해제된 거야?! 다, 당신들은 대체 누구지?! 어째서 헬라 같은 돌머리와 같이 있는 거야!","source_cn":"……全都……解除了？！你、你们到底是谁？！怎么会跟着海...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFDCE34018A5D633","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421345002:1":{"text":"어이, 조금 전 내 얘기 못 들었어? 넌 지금 내 실험실에 있다고! 내 연구 재료를 쓰고, 내 노트를 읽었잖아? 자, 이제 내가 누군지 네 입으로 직접 얘기해 봐!","source_cn":"呵，没听到我刚刚说的话吗？你在我的实验室里！用着我的研...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07931700F140F749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421345003:1":{"text":"...이제 알겠네.\n당신은 플린 그 드워프 배신자의 끄나풀이지!","source_cn":"……我知道了。\\n你就是弗林那个矮人叛徒的走狗吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20C12A04B19A5628","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421345004:1":{"text":"...뭐라고?!","source_cn":"……啥？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFB8929CF7B4B392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1421345004":{"text":"...뭐라고?!","source_cn":"……啥？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFB8929CF7B4B392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document